 toggle on a single visible wash. Mintlify ships each with its\n   own bg utility (Sign in \u0026 Faucet: bg-gray-950/[0.03], toggle:\n   bg-gray-800/[0.04] / dark:bg-white/10), so at rest the three\n   look mismatched.\n\n   We also apply the dark-mode value via prefers-color-scheme in\n   addition to html.dark. Mintlify renders the SSR HTML without\n   .dark on \u003chtml\u003e and only adds it after hydration; meanwhile\n   the page background already paints dark (inlined from\n   docs.json background.color.dark). That gap is what causes the\n   \"flash\" where pills look like light-mode washes on a dark\n   page. prefers-color-scheme lands the right color on first paint\n   for the common case (system-dark users); html.dark re-asserts\n   it for users who manually toggle dark on a light system.\n\n   Values are subtle neutral washes — visible enough to read as\n   pill chrome on either surface, quiet enough not to compete with\n   the search bar and the primary CTA.\n\n   Trade-off: a user with a dark system preference who has\n   manually toggled the docs to light will briefly see a\n   transparent-looking pill on a white page, because the @media\n   rule wins until hydration adds .dark (or in this case, removes\n   the absence-of-.dark default) and the page repaints. Acceptable\n   until we add a pre-paint inline script that reads localStorage\n   and sets the theme class before first paint.\n   ============================================================ */\n#navbar [data-component-name=\"theme-toggle\"],\n#navbar a[href*=\"console.circle.com\"],\n#navbar a[href*=\"faucet.circle.com\"],\n#navbar .navbar-link a {\n  background-color: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.03) !important;\n}\n\n#navbar [data-component-name=\"theme-toggle\"]:hover,\n#navbar a[href*=\"console.circle.com\"]:hover,\n#navbar a[href*=\"faucet.circle.com\"]:hover,\n#navbar .navbar-link a:hover {\n  background-color: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.07) !important;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  #navbar [data-component-name=\"theme-toggle\"],\n  #navbar a[href*=\"console.circle.com\"],\n  #navbar a[href*=\"faucet.circle.com\"],\n  #navbar .navbar-link a {\n    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) !important;\n  }\n\n  #navbar [data-component-name=\"theme-toggle\"]:hover,\n  #navbar a[href*=\"console.circle.com\"]:hover,\n  #navbar a[href*=\"faucet.circle.com\"]:hover,\n  #navbar .navbar-link a:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) !important;\n  }\n}\n\nhtml.dark #navbar [data-component-name=\"theme-toggle\"],\nhtml.dark #navbar a[href*=\"console.circle.com\"],\nhtml.dark #navbar a[href*=\"faucet.circle.com\"],\nhtml.dark #navbar .navbar-link a {\n  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) !important;\n}\n\nhtml.dark #navbar [data-component-name=\"theme-toggle\"]:hover,\nhtml.dark #navbar a[href*=\"console.circle.com\"]:hover,\nhtml.dark #navbar a[href*=\"faucet.circle.com\"]:hover,\nhtml.dark #navbar .navbar-link a:hover {\n  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) !important;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   EDS dark-mode primary button text fix\n   Per EDS text-invert token: dark mode text on bold-interactive\n   backgrounds should be black (#000000) for WCAG AA contrast\n   (white on #1AA3FF = 2.7:1, black on #1AA3FF = 7.7:1).\n   ============================================================ */\nhtml.dark #topbar-cta-button,\nhtml.dark #topbar-cta-button a {\n  color: #000000 !important;\n}\n\nhtml.dark #feedback-form-submit {\n  color: #000000 !important;\n}\n\nhtml.dark tryit-button {\n  color: #000000 !important;\n}\n\nhtml.dark chat-assistant-send-button {\n  color: #000000 !important;\n}\n\nhtml.dark contextual-feedback-form-submit-button {\n  color: #000000 !important;\n}\n\nhtml.dark code-snippet-feedback-form-submit-button {\n  color: #000000 !important;\n}\n\n/* Hero primary CTA in HeroSection.jsx — Mintlify's Tailwind compilation\n   for snippet files doesn't reliably pick up da